## 4. Component Architecture

| Component | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| **Auth Service** | Sign-up/login, session issuance, GitHub OAuth linking/unlinking. |
| **Target Service** | CRUD for target jobs; triggers job description analysis. |
| **Resume Service** | Handles PDF upload, text extraction, AI-based skill/project extraction, user confirmation flow. |
| **Skill Gap Engine** | Deterministic + AI-assisted comparison of target requirements vs. user profile/evidence; assigns skill status. |
| **Evidence Engine** | Aggregates evidence records from all sources; computes Evidence Level (0–5) per skill. |
| **Roadmap Engine** | Generates roadmap items, project recommendations, milestones, Definitions of Done; recalculates on relevant state changes. |
| **GitHub Sync Service** | OAuth token management, repository import, metadata/technology/CI-CD/test detection, scheduled + manual sync. |
| **Scoring Service** | Computes Job Match, Skill Coverage, Evidence Strength, Portfolio Strength, Production Readiness, and overall Readiness. |
| **Background Job Runner** | Executes async work (AI calls, GitHub sync) outside the request/response cycle; tracks job status for polling. |
| **Skill Normalization module** (shared library used by Job/Resume/GitHub services) | Maps raw extracted terms to canonical `Skill` entities via aliases/categories. |

